<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Página no encontrada · CCM</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ubuntu:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Ubuntu", sans-serif;
            background: #fff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .site-header {
            border-top: 3px solid #b25828;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
        }

        .site-name {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .page-wrap {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem 6rem;
        }

        .error-block {
            padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #e5e4e2;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #555;
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        }

        .links {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .back-link {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #b25828;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .back-link:hover { color: #7e411d; }

        .alt-link {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .alt-link:hover { color: #b25828; }

        @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
            .site-header { padding: 0.75rem 1rem; }
            .page-wrap { padding: 0 1rem 4rem; }
            .error-code { font-size: 3.5rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-header">
        <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="site-name">Centro de Ciencias Matemáticas &middot; UNAM</a>
    </header>

    <div class="page-wrap">
        <div class="error-block">
            <div class="error-code">404</div>
            <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
            <p>La dirección que buscas no existe o fue movida.</p>
            <div class="links">
                <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="back-link">← Regresar al inicio</a>
                <a href="{{ path('app_event_seminar_index') }}" class="alt-link">Ver todos los eventos</a>
                <a href="{{ path('app_seminario_index') }}" class="alt-link">Ver seminarios</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
